## Architecture & Code Reuse

### Layers

```
app/
├── components/ui/       → Reusable base components (Button, Card, etc.)
├── components/layout/   → Layout components (Header, Sidebar)
├── components/{feature}/ → Feature-specific components (tasks/, habits/, focus/, planner/)
├── composables/         → Shared logic (useAuth, useTasks, usePreferences, useSound, etc.)
├── stores/              → Pinia stores (useDrawerStore, etc.)
├── types/               → Shared TypeScript interfaces and enums
├── layouts/             → Nuxt layouts (default, auth, focus, minimal)
├── middleware/          → Route guards (auth.global.ts)
├── pages/               → Route pages
└── utils/               → Pure utility functions

server/
├── api/{resource}/      → REST API routes (file-based: index.get.ts, [id].put.ts, etc.)
├── middleware/          → Server middleware (auth injection)
└── utils/               → Server helpers (auth.ts, prisma.ts, response.ts)
```

