## Don'ts

- Do NOT use SCSS or CSS preprocessors
- Do NOT install additional UI component libraries (Nuxt UI is already included for specific needs)
- Do NOT add comments to the code
- Do NOT create duplicate types — always check `app/types/index.ts` first
- Do NOT use `any` type without justification
- Do NOT hardcode design tokens — use CSS custom properties
- Do NOT create composables that duplicate existing ones — extend them instead
- Do NOT use `<div>` for interactive elements — use `<button>` or `<a>`
